msgid "安装 ReliefOS"
msgstr "Installing ReliefOS"

msgid "安装前"
msgstr "Before Installation"

msgid ""
"备份目标磁盘。安装器的重新分区、格式化会破坏所选磁盘的数据； 先用磁盘型号、容量和现有分区核对身份，不能只凭设备编号判断。 默认介质包括 "
"``reliefos-installer.iso``、``reliefos-live.iso`` 和 ``reliefos.vmdk``， 同一介质支持"
" Legacy BIOS 与 UEFI。ISO 使用双 El Torito 光盘入口， 不承诺是可直接写入 U 盘的 hybrid 镜像。"
msgstr ""
"Back up the target disk. Repartitioning and formatting by the installer "
"destroy data on the selected disk. Verify its identity using the model, "
"capacity, and existing partitions, rather than relying only on the device "
"number. Default media include ``reliefos-installer.iso``, ``reliefos-"
"live.iso``, and ``reliefos.vmdk``; the same medium supports Legacy BIOS and "
"UEFI. The ISO uses dual El Torito optical boot entries and is not guaranteed"
" to be a hybrid image that can be written directly to a USB drive."

msgid "安装器运行时、Live 会话和安装后的系统是不同的根文件系统。 只有实际安装并移除 ISO 后启动成功，才能证明安装后的系统可用。"
msgstr ""
"The installer runtime, Live session, and installed system use different root"
" filesystems. Only a successful boot after actual installation and removal "
"of the ISO proves that the installed system is usable."

msgid "全新安装"
msgstr "Fresh Installation"

msgid ""
"在 GRUB 中选择图形安装或控制台安装；控制台会话条目为 ``Install ReliefOS (console "
"session)``。图形向导依次选择语言、安装模式、目标磁盘、 引导方式、分区和账户，最后确认安装。TTY 同样在分区之前选择引导方式。 Xorg "
"桌面默认安装，也可选择纯控制台系统。"
msgstr ""
"Choose graphical or console installation in GRUB; the console session entry "
"is ``Install ReliefOS (console session)``. The graphical wizard proceeds "
"through language, installation mode, target disk, boot method, partitions, "
"and accounts, followed by final confirmation. The TTY also selects the boot "
"method before partitioning. The Xorg desktop is installed by default; a "
"console-only system can also be selected."

msgid ""
"图形向导在语言选择后显示 Apache License 2.0 英文原文，可滚动阅读全文。 该文本直接取自仓库的 "
"``LICENSE``，中文界面也保留许可证原文。"
msgstr ""
"After language selection, the graphical wizard displays the original English"
" Apache License 2.0, with scrolling to read the full text. This text comes "
"directly from the repository's ``LICENSE``; the Chinese interface also "
"retains the original license text."

msgid ""
"新安装默认同时安装 BIOS、UEFI 引导器，可分别取消。两者都取消时不写入 可直接启动的 loader，必须另行配置引导。自动 GPT "
"布局根据所选引导方式生成："
msgstr ""
"A fresh installation installs both BIOS and UEFI boot loaders by default; "
"either can be deselected. If both are deselected, no directly bootable "
"loader is written, and boot must be configured separately. The automatic GPT"
" layout is generated according to the chosen boot methods:"

msgid ""
"选择 BIOS 时创建 1 MiB 未格式化 BIOS Boot 分区；只选 UEFI 或都不选时省去该分区。 BIOS Boot "
"不能格式化、挂载或直接占用已有文件系统。"
msgstr ""
"Selecting BIOS creates a 1 MiB unformatted BIOS Boot partition; it is "
"omitted when only UEFI or neither method is selected. BIOS Boot must not be "
"formatted, mounted, or placed directly over an existing filesystem."

msgid ""
"所有方案都创建 128 MiB FAT32 ESP，保存内核、GRUB 配置及所选引导器的资源。 BIOS 引导同样从该 FAT32 "
"分区读取启动资源，不能因为只选 BIOS 而删除它。"
msgstr ""
"Every layout creates a 128 MiB FAT32 ESP for the kernel, GRUB configuration,"
" and resources for the selected loaders. BIOS boot also reads boot resources"
" from this FAT32 partition; do not remove it just because only BIOS is "
"selected."

msgid "剩余整 MiB 空间用作 ext4 根分区。"
msgstr "The remaining whole-MiB space becomes the ext4 root partition."

msgid ""
"分区页显示当前磁盘分区，以及尚未写入的自动方案和预计根分区容量。 最终确认安装时才执行待应用的自动方案；分区工具中的 ``Automatic`` / "
"``auto`` 则在独立擦盘确认后立即创建 GPT，最终安装时再格式化 ESP 和根分区。 "
"返回修改引导方式会重新计算待应用的方案和校验已有分区，不会自动再次擦盘。 已应用的两分区布局改选 BIOS 后，必须显式重新自动分区或手动补齐合格的 "
"BIOS Boot 分区；手动布局必须提供所选引导方式所需的分区才能继续。"
msgstr ""
"The partition page shows existing disk partitions, the automatic plan not "
"yet written, and the estimated root partition size. A pending automatic plan"
" is applied only at final installation confirmation. By contrast, "
"``Automatic`` / ``auto`` in the partition tool creates GPT immediately after"
" a separate disk-erasure confirmation; ESP and root are formatted during "
"final installation. Going back to change the boot method recalculates the "
"pending plan and validates existing partitions without automatically erasing"
" the disk again. If an already applied two-partition layout is changed to "
"BIOS, explicitly rerun automatic partitioning or manually add a valid BIOS "
"Boot partition. A manual layout must supply the partitions required by the "
"selected boot methods before proceeding."

msgid ""
"格式化前会检查所选载荷需要的空间和 inode。菜单通过 GPT PARTUUID 绑定 根分区；缺失、无效或重复身份应报错，不能以连接顺序替代身份。 "
"完成后正常关机、移除安装介质，再从目标磁盘启动。"
msgstr ""
"Before formatting, the installer checks the space and inode requirements of "
"the selected payload. Menus bind the root partition by GPT PARTUUID. "
"Missing, invalid, or duplicate identities must produce an error; connection "
"order must not replace identity. After completion, shut down normally, "
"remove the installation medium, and boot from the target disk."

msgid ""
"全新安装可选择创建根分区的 ``/swapfile``，默认不选。建议值为内存大小向上 取整到 MiB 后限制在 512 MiB 至 2 "
"GiB；可以手动填写其他有效的整数 MiB， 安装器不会自动缩小。所需文件空间和余量在重新分区或格式化之前一起检查。 "
"该选项要求所选目标系统的已验证内核包启用 swap，且目标磁盘的真实 PCI 父 控制器为 AHCI；当前不支持用 NVMe、IDE 或其他存储作为这个"
" swap 后端。 安装器不会在 Live 或安装器会话中启用目标 swap。"
msgstr ""
"Fresh installations can optionally create ``/swapfile`` on the root "
"partition; this is unchecked by default. The suggested size is RAM rounded "
"up to MiB, clamped to 512 MiB–2 GiB. Other valid integer MiB values can be "
"entered manually; the installer does not shrink them automatically. File "
"space and required headroom are checked together before repartitioning or "
"formatting. This option requires swap to be enabled in the selected target "
"system's verified kernel package and the target disk's actual PCI parent "
"controller to be AHCI. NVMe, IDE, and other storage are not currently "
"supported as this swap backend. The installer does not activate target swap "
"in the Live or installer session."

msgid ""
"安装器完整写入并格式化文件，设置 root 所有、权限 0600，再发布 fstab 和 OpenRC 配置。标准 swap 服务在 "
"localmount 后运行；项目检查服务会核对 ``/proc/swaps`` 中实际出现的 ``/swapfile``，以便发现配置存在但启用失败的"
" 情况。重启后可检查 ``/proc/swaps`` 以及服务状态。磁盘 I/O 或清理本身失败时， "
"安装器会报告错误；单文件同步和替换不构成跨文件的断电原子事务。"
msgstr ""
"The installer fully writes and formats the file, sets root ownership and "
"mode 0600, then publishes fstab and OpenRC configuration. The standard swap "
"service runs after localmount; the project's check service verifies that "
"``/swapfile`` actually appears in ``/proc/swaps`` to detect configured-but-"
"inactive swap. After reboot, inspect ``/proc/swaps`` and service status. "
"Disk I/O or cleanup failures are reported as errors. Syncing and replacing "
"individual files does not form a power-failure-atomic transaction across "
"files."

msgid ""
"未选择此项时不会自动启用 swap。手工配置须先准备完全分配、位于支持的 AHCI SATA 设备上的专用文件或未挂载分区，再使用 ``mkswap``"
" 初始化并通过 ``swapon`` 激活；``mkswap`` 会覆盖所选目标。只有完成身份核对和必要备份后 才能执行。``swapoff`` "
"需要先恢复仍被引用的页面，内存不足时可能失败并保留 活动区域；不能把失败当成已卸载，也不保证所有后续分配立即成功。"
msgstr ""
"If this option is not selected, swap is not enabled automatically. For "
"manual configuration, first prepare a fully allocated dedicated file or "
"unmounted partition on a supported AHCI SATA device, initialize it with "
"``mkswap``, and activate it with ``swapon``. ``mkswap`` overwrites the "
"selected target; run it only after verifying identity and making necessary "
"backups. ``swapoff`` must first restore pages that are still referenced. If "
"memory is insufficient, it may fail and leave the area active; failure must "
"not be treated as successful deactivation, nor is immediate success of all "
"subsequent allocations guaranteed."

msgid "共享 ESP 与多系统"
msgstr "Shared ESP and Multiple Operating Systems"

msgid ""
"与已有系统共存时选择手动分区，为 ReliefOS 指定单独的根分区。 所选根分区会格式化；已有 FAT32 ESP 默认保留，不要求它达到自动方案的 "
"128 MiB，但必须有足够剩余空间。只有显式勾选格式化 ESP 才会清除其中的 所有 EFI 文件。TTY 对应 ``format-esp yes``"
" / ``format-esp no``。 自动分区仍是明确的整盘擦除方案，不是保留其他系统的并列安装。"
msgstr ""
"To coexist with an existing system, choose manual partitioning and assign a "
"separate root partition to ReliefOS. The selected root partition is "
"formatted. An existing FAT32 ESP is preserved by default and need not meet "
"the automatic plan's 128 MiB size, but must have enough free space. All EFI "
"files on it are erased only if Format ESP is explicitly checked. The TTY "
"equivalents are ``format-esp yes`` / ``format-esp no``. Automatic "
"partitioning remains an explicit whole-disk erasure plan, not a side-by-side"
" installation that preserves other systems."

msgid ""
"新安装将物理 ESP 挂到 ``/efi``，并把 ``/efi/reliefos/instances/<根分区 PARTUUID>`` bind 到 "
"``/boot``。 每个实例有独立的 GRUB 配置、根分区绑定、A/B 内核状态和版本文件； "
"内核包更新检查实例所有权，拒绝把当前根的内核发布到另一个实例。 initramfs 在切换真实根之前按 fstab 完成两层挂载。"
msgstr ""
"New installations mount the physical ESP at ``/efi`` and bind "
"``/efi/reliefos/instances/<根分区 PARTUUID>`` to ``/boot``. Each instance has "
"its own GRUB configuration, root binding, A/B kernel state, and version "
"files. Kernel package updates verify instance ownership and refuse to "
"publish the current root's kernel to another instance. Before switching to "
"the real root, initramfs performs both mount layers according to fstab."

msgid ""
"UEFI 文件位于 ``/EFI/ReliefOS/<根分区 PARTUUID>/grubx64.efi``； 标准厂商入口 "
"``/EFI/ReliefOS/grubx64.efi`` 指向一个已有安装，其菜单可选择其他实例。 已有的其他系统 EFI 文件和未知的 "
"``/EFI/BOOT/BOOTX64.EFI`` 保持不变。 只有空的 fallback 路径，或内容摘要和所有权记录均匹配的 ReliefOS "
"fallback， 才会被安装或更新。固件启动变量和 BootOrder 不由此文件复制过程修改； 若固件没有显示新入口，使用完成页显示的 EFI "
"文件路径添加启动项。"
msgstr ""
"UEFI files reside at ``/EFI/ReliefOS/<根分区 PARTUUID>/grubx64.efi``. The "
"standard vendor entry ``/EFI/ReliefOS/grubx64.efi`` points to an existing "
"installation whose menu can select other instances. Other systems' existing "
"EFI files and any unknown ``/EFI/BOOT/BOOTX64.EFI`` are left unchanged. Only"
" an empty fallback path or a ReliefOS fallback whose content digest and "
"ownership record both match may be installed or updated. This file-copy "
"process does not alter firmware boot variables or BootOrder. If firmware "
"does not display the new entry, add a boot entry using the EFI path shown on"
" the completion page."

msgid ""
"GRUB 在启动时枚举其他 ReliefOS 实例；UEFI 菜单识别常见的 Windows、 shim/GRUB 和 systemd-boot "
"文件，BIOS 菜单支持 Windows 分区引导及其他 系统的 GRUB 配置。其他系统的配置只在用户选择相应条目后执行。 BIOS "
"安装会替换所选整盘的主引导代码；只需 UEFI 共存时可取消 BIOS。 旧预制磁盘若没有 ESP 上的 ``core.img`` 副本，更新器会校验 "
"MBR 中的 GRUB 核心位置及 BIOS Boot 分区内的块列表，识别实际嵌入的引导器。 新预制镜像同时保存该副本，保持与安装器生成的布局一致。"
msgstr ""
"At boot, GRUB enumerates other ReliefOS instances. UEFI menus recognize "
"common Windows, shim/GRUB, and systemd-boot files; BIOS menus support "
"Windows partition booting and GRUB configurations from other systems. Other "
"systems' configurations execute only after the user selects their entry. "
"BIOS installation replaces the master boot code of the selected whole disk; "
"deselect BIOS if only UEFI coexistence is needed. For old prebuilt disks "
"without a copy of ``core.img`` on the ESP, the updater checks the GRUB core "
"location in the MBR and block lists in the BIOS Boot partition to identify "
"the embedded loader. New prebuilt images also retain this copy, matching "
"installer-generated layouts."

msgid ""
"Live 只有一个普通启动项。安装介质保留图形和控制台两个安装入口； 磁盘保留普通启动及高级选项中的日志暂停、关闭内核日志颜色和有效旧内核回退。 "
"不再展示失效的 debug/autospawn 参数、重复日志条目或同内核副本伪装的回退。 ISO 优先从固件交接的实际介质加载菜单，Live 与 "
"Installer 的后备标记相互独立。"
msgstr ""
"Live has a single normal boot entry. Installation media retain graphical and"
" console installation entries; disks retain normal boot and advanced options"
" for pausing logs, disabling kernel log colors, and falling back to a valid "
"old kernel. Obsolete debug/autospawn parameters, duplicate log entries, and "
"copies of the same kernel disguised as fallbacks are no longer shown. ISOs "
"prefer loading menus from the actual medium handed over by firmware, with "
"independent fallback markers for Live and Installer."

msgid "独立磁盘镜像身份"
msgstr "Independent Disk Image Identities"

msgid ""
"``IMAGE_INSTANCE_ID``（也可在 menuconfig 中设置 ``DISK_INSTANCE_ID``） 决定预制磁盘的 GPT "
"磁盘和分区身份，并同步生成 fstab、GRUB 根绑定和查找标记。 同一输入、同一实例标识保持可重现；需要同时连接的镜像应使用不同标识，例如::"
msgstr ""
"``IMAGE_INSTANCE_ID`` (also configurable as ``DISK_INSTANCE_ID`` in "
"menuconfig) determines GPT disk and partition identities for prebuilt disks,"
" generating matching fstab, GRUB root bindings, and search markers. "
"Identical input and instance IDs remain reproducible. Images that will be "
"attached simultaneously should use different IDs, for example::"

msgid ""
"逐字节复制一张已有磁盘仍会复制其 UUID，不能把这样的副本当作独立安装同时连接。 正式安装到不同根分区时使用各自 GPT "
"身份，不依赖预制镜像的实例标识。"
msgstr ""
"Copying an existing disk byte for byte also copies its UUIDs; such a copy "
"cannot be attached simultaneously as an independent installation. Actual "
"installations on different root partitions use their respective GPT "
"identities and do not depend on prebuilt image instance IDs."

msgid "更新已有系统"
msgstr "Updating an Existing System"

msgid ""
"更新不自动重分区。旧两分区 UEFI 磁盘保持原有布局，缺少 BIOS Boot 空间时增加 BIOS "
"引导的请求应在写入前失败。先备份用户文件和引导分区， 检查已安装 APK 数据库、信任密钥及所选更新介质。正常关闭已安装系统后， 再从安装介质启动。 "
"在安装器中选择更新和目标磁盘后，独立的后台进程只读检查已安装系统、桌面 类型、软件包数据库、安装介质和空间。确认页列出当前版本、介质版本、根分区、 "
"ESP 和空间需求，并默认选中已检测到的 BIOS/UEFI 引导器。核对后点击更新。 同盘有多个安装时，可在目标磁盘页选择明确的根分区和 ESP；留空"
" ESP 时读取 所选根的 fstab，不能简单取磁盘上第一个 ESP。显式选择与该根的 fstab 不一致时 "
"拒绝更新，避免把引导文件写到其他系统的分区。旧的 ``/boot`` 直接挂载 FAT32 布局继续兼容，更新不强制改变现有挂载布局。 "
"旧布局中未能通过所有权验证的现有 EFI 可执行文件及相邻配置会保留， 不会因系统更新而覆盖。兼容命令 ``reliefos-grub-"
"installer`` 现直接转交原生 CLI，需要明确的 ``--disk``、``--boot-directory`` 和根分区身份； "
"不再接受无法绑定安装实例的旧式单个 ESP 路径复制操作。 TTY 入口使用相同的后端，并在显示摘要和引导选项后通过 ``y/N`` 确认。"
msgstr ""
"Updates do not repartition automatically. Old two-partition UEFI disks "
"retain their layout; a request to add BIOS boot without BIOS Boot space must"
" fail before writing. First back up user files and boot partitions, and "
"check the installed APK database, trusted keys, and selected update medium. "
"Shut down the installed system normally before booting installation media. "
"After Update and a target disk are selected in the installer, a separate "
"background process performs read-only checks of the installed system, "
"desktop type, package database, installation medium, and space. The "
"confirmation page lists the current and medium versions, root partition, "
"ESP, and space requirements, with detected BIOS/UEFI loaders selected by "
"default. Verify these and click Update. If the same disk contains multiple "
"installations, choose an explicit root partition and ESP on the target disk "
"page. Leaving ESP blank reads the selected root's fstab, rather than simply "
"taking the disk's first ESP. An explicit selection inconsistent with that "
"root's fstab is rejected to avoid writing boot files to another system's "
"partition. Legacy layouts mounting FAT32 directly at ``/boot`` remain "
"compatible; updates do not force changes to existing mounts. Existing EFI "
"executables and adjacent configuration in old layouts that cannot pass "
"ownership verification are preserved, rather than overwritten by the system "
"update. The compatibility command ``reliefos-grub-installer`` now forwards "
"directly to the native CLI, requiring explicit ``--disk``, ``--boot-"
"directory``, and root partition identity. It no longer accepts the old "
"operation of copying to a single ESP path without binding an installation "
"instance. The TTY entry uses the same backend and requests ``y/N`` "
"confirmation after showing the summary and boot options."

msgid ""
"检查过程使用私有 APK 数据库和已安装系统的信任密钥，验证签名索引、完整 软件包归档以及离线依赖。确认后的执行会再次核对磁盘、分区 UUID、索引和 "
"已安装包数据库及 world 选择；目标已经变化时需要重新检查。已被其他路径挂载的分区、 无法唯一识别的根分区或 "
"ESP，以及早于已安装系统的介质会在写入前被拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"Checks use a private APK database and the installed system's trusted keys to"
" verify signed indexes, complete package archives, and offline dependencies."
" Execution after confirmation rechecks disks, partition UUIDs, indexes, the "
"installed package database, and world selections; changed targets require a "
"fresh check. Partitions already mounted elsewhere, roots or ESPs that cannot"
" be uniquely identified, and media older than the installed system are "
"rejected before writing."

msgid ""
"根文件系统使用 APK 更新，保留外部包、world 选择和受保护配置；新默认配置 可能以 ``.apk-new`` 出现。根事务成功后才发布引导文件。"
" 离线更新只从安装介质的签名仓库取得新软件包。``world`` 中已有的 ``@testing``、``@alpine`` "
"等标签在本次事务的私有配置中注册到该仓库， 使已安装的外部软件包可以继续满足依赖，不要求原仓库在线或保留索引缓存。 "
"原有仓库配置和标签选择保持不变；介质和已安装软件包无法满足的版本约束 仍会在预检查时拒绝，不会强制忽略依赖。 更新保留现有 fstab 和 swap "
"设置，不会自动添加或更改交换文件。 更新详情显示软件包和引导操作的实际输出，完整日志位于安装器运行环境的 ``/var/log/installer-"
"update.log``。失败页面提供重新检查入口。"
msgstr ""
"The root filesystem is updated with APK, preserving external packages, world"
" selections, and protected configuration; new defaults may appear as ``.apk-"
"new``. Boot files are published only after the root transaction succeeds. "
"Offline updates obtain new packages only from the installation medium's "
"signed repository. Existing tags in ``world``, such as ``@testing`` and "
"``@alpine``, are registered against that repository in the transaction's "
"private configuration, allowing installed external packages to continue "
"satisfying dependencies without requiring their original repositories online"
" or cached indexes. Existing repository configuration and tag selections "
"remain unchanged. Version constraints that cannot be satisfied by the medium"
" and installed packages are still rejected during preflight; dependencies "
"are not forcibly ignored. Updates preserve existing fstab and swap settings "
"and do not automatically add or change swap files. Update details show "
"actual output from package and boot operations; the full log is at "
"``/var/log/installer-update.log`` in the installer runtime. The failure page"
" provides a way to recheck."

msgid ""
"更新进度会显示当前的软件包或缓存归档、已处理数量和缓存大小，以及已复用的 缓存大小。大小按完成比较或发布的整个文件累计，正在复制的文件完成后计入； "
"包事务中的数量只计入当前包之前已处理的包。缓存归档和签名索引逐字节相同 时直接复用，内容不同则先写入独立临时文件并校验，再替换原文件。比较或写入 "
"出错会终止本次更新，日志和失败页保留步骤、文件名及命令退出状态，供重试定位。"
msgstr ""
"Update progress shows the current package or cached archive, processed "
"count, cache size, and reused cache size. Sizes accumulate whole files after"
" comparison or publication completes; a file being copied is counted only "
"when finished. Package-transaction counts include only packages processed "
"before the current package. Byte-identical cached archives and signed "
"indexes are reused directly; differing contents are first written to "
"separate temporary files, verified, and then replace the originals. "
"Comparison or write errors terminate the update. The log and failure page "
"retain the step, filename, and command exit status for diagnosing retries."

msgid ""
"目标系统的 ``/var/lib/reliefos/installer-update/state`` 持久记录软件包、根同步、 "
"引导提交和完成阶段。同一介质的引导提交失败后，重新检查会核对已完成的根 事务，再继续引导提交；软件包阶段失败则重新预检并执行包事务。旧内核模块 保留与 "
"A/B 内核发布继续使用共同的原生引导接口。更新期间由独立进程持有 安装器更新锁，释放目标挂载后才报告完成。APK 已记录为损坏的系统包会先通过 "
"已验证的归档执行定向修复，再执行升级；已有的外部包错误保留并在日志中说明。"
msgstr ""
"The target system's ``/var/lib/reliefos/installer-update/state`` "
"persistently records package, root sync, boot commit, and completion phases."
" After a boot commit fails for the same medium, rechecking verifies the "
"completed root transaction and resumes the boot commit; a package-phase "
"failure triggers a fresh preflight and package transaction. Retention of old"
" kernel modules and A/B kernel publishing continue to share the native boot "
"interface. A separate process holds the installer update lock throughout the"
" update, reporting completion only after releasing target mounts. System "
"packages marked broken by APK are first repaired selectively using verified "
"archives, then upgraded. Existing external-package errors are retained and "
"explained in the log."

msgid ""
"旧内核包清单中的 ``kerneldebug.sys`` 作为可选历史成员继续校验、保留和恢复， 以支持升级旧安装；新内核包和 ESP "
"发布不生成该文件。历史成员若损坏或是符号 链接，仍会拒绝更新，不会跳过内核包完整性检查。"
msgstr ""
"``kerneldebug.sys`` in old kernel package manifests continues to be "
"verified, retained, and restored as an optional historical member to support"
" upgrading old installations. New kernel packages and ESP publishing do not "
"generate this file. A corrupted or symbolic-link historical member still "
"causes update rejection; kernel package integrity checks are not skipped."

msgid ""
"单文件原子替换不等于全部包、ESP 和 BIOS 写入的整体断电原子事务。 回退条目只使用通过完整性检查的匹配内核与 "
"initramfs，不把当前内核的别名当作回退。"
msgstr ""
"Atomic replacement of a single file is not a power-failure-atomic "
"transaction covering all packages, ESP, and BIOS writes. Fallback entries "
"use only matching kernels and initramfs images that pass integrity checks, "
"never aliases of the current kernel presented as fallbacks."

msgid "运行验证和未覆盖范围见 :doc:`limitations`。"
msgstr "For runtime verification and uncovered areas, see :doc:`limitations`."
